==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's shiny super rare illustration features a {{Shiny}} {{p|Flareon}}.
*'''Combust''' is an {{TCG|Ability}} that first appeared as '''Overheat''', a {{TCG|Poké-Power}} on {{TCG ID|EX Team Magma vs Team Aqua|Team Magma's Camerupt|19}} from the {{TCG|EX Team Magma vs Team Aqua}} expansion.
*{{m|Fire Spin}} is a [[move]] in the [[Pokémon games]] that {{p|Flareon}} can learn.

